    User "1" --> "0..*" Pet : owns
    User "1" --> "0..*" Task : creates
    Task "0..*" --> "0..*" Pet : is for
    Task "0..*" --> "0..*" Task : depends on
    User "1" --> "0..2" Schedule : reviews candidates
    User "1" --> "0..1" Schedule : saved_schedule
    Schedule "0..*" ..> "0..*" Task : places
    User ..> Schedule : builds candidates
    Schedule ..> TimeHelpers : compares times with
    Task ..> TimeHelpers : compares times with
    User ..> TimeHelpers : sizes events with
